{"at":"2026-11-21T21:20:56.672Z","kind":"said","text":"The page now reads **15,020 files** under your exclusions. That's the \"will be read\" count in the header, which is the preview before you press Scan. I didn't press Scan.\n\nThe two lines that did the excluding, entered in the \"Your list\" box:\n\n```\n*.png\nDNN Platform/Tests/\n```\n\nBefore the lines, the header showed 17,244 files. The exclusions removed 2,224 files, and the \"Left out\" panel attributes all of them to your list: 1 folder, plus 1,325 `.png` files. The `DNN Platform` count fell from 13,097 to 11,148."}
